<title>USA: Tuesday Morning Q4 net sales rise 22 pct.</title>
<headline>Tuesday Morning Q4 net sales rise 22 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tuesday Morning Corp said Thursday its net sales for its fourth quarter event, through November 30, 1996, increased 22 percent, to $83.9 million, compared with $68.6 million in the corresponding period of the previous year.</p>
<p>Comparable stores sales rose 13.2 percent.</p>
</text>
